BF%E4%BA%9A%E7%AF%87%E3%80%8C%E5%86%B0%E4%B8%8E%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%E3%80%8D%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5PV&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2026-01-16<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F760922031750381643\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/760922031750381643</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%86%B0%E4%B8%8E%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5pv.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"冰与血之路概念pv.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/17/5ninb3q20u0b5h6l052bacg7yzz9mzr.png/300px-%E5%86%B0%E4%B8%8E%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5pv.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"176\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/17/5ninb3q20u0b5h6l052bacg7yzz9mzr.png/450px-%E5%86%B0%E4%B8%8E%E8%A1%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5pv.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/5ninb3q20u0b5h6l052bacg7yzz9mzr.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><big><big><font color=\"#f3c156\"><b>「冰与血之路」</b></font></big></big><b><br /></b>\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font><br /><br /></small>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1t8rZBVEPM\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"「冰与血之路」概念PV\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"280\"></div><br />\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n很久很久以前，永夜的极寒吞噬了整座冰原。仁慈的露西亚女神，带领她的子民踏上了南迁之路。<br /><br />长路艰险，人们被风雪吹散，为冰川阻隔。<br /><br />女神唯有停下脚步，用温暖的怀抱庇佑她心爱的孩子们。<br /><br />从此，露西亚之拥不再寒冷，露西亚之泪哺育了冰原众生。<br /><br />而她永恒不灭的心，则静卧在万古冰川深处，阻绝着黑暗与严寒的南袭。<br /><br />那便是冰原之心。<br /><br />女神从未离我们而去。她的意志在每一位露西亚后裔的血脉中流淌。她在等待，她在召唤。\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164214\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 118/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2952/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 262/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.584      1 -total\n 50.82%   15.035      1 模板:面包屑\n 41.24%   12.200      1 模板:文章戳\n  7.35%    2.173      1 模板:B站视频\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7474-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164214 and revision id 18049. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"PV","missing":true}],"images":["冰与血之路概念pv.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV"}],"displaytitle":"《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|PV}}\n=《铃兰之剑》露西亚篇「冰与血之路」概念PV=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=PV\n|时间=2026-01-16\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/760922031750381643\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n[[文件:冰与血之路概念pv.png|300px]]\n</div>\n<br>\n<center>\n<big><big><font color=#f3c156>'''「冰与血之路」</font></big></big><br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font><br><br></small>\n{{B站视频|BV1t8rZBVEPM|1|「冰与血之路」概念PV|560|280}}<br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<br><br>\n很久很久以前，永夜的极寒吞噬了整座冰原。仁慈的露西亚女神，带领她的子民踏上了南迁之路。<br><br>长路艰险，人们被风雪吹散，为冰川阻隔。<br><br>女神唯有停下脚步，用温暖的怀抱庇佑她心爱的孩子们。<br><br>从此，露西亚之拥不再寒冷，露西亚之泪哺育了冰原众生。<br><br>而她永恒不灭的心，则静卧在万古冰川深处，阻绝着黑暗与严寒的南袭。<br><br>那便是冰原之心。<br><br>女神从未离我们而去。她的意志在每一位露西亚后裔的血脉中流淌。她在等待，她在召唤。\n<br><br>\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:14.567635+00:00"}